  "description": "Experience the upgraded AWD dual motor with 3000W peak power, featuring 1000W front and rear motors that deliver 1500W each, and a combined torque of 190Nm for unmatched performance on any terrain.\n\nEquipped with both 48V and 52V lithium-ion battery options, the AndSky e-bike features a powerful 25Ah capacity, offering an impressive range of 60 to 100 miles on a single charge, ensuring a reliable and long-lasting ride for your adventures. With this range, please use PAS level 1 and engage pedal assist when using PAS 1, especially when riding with the rear motor. You can also add a rear rack battery option to further extend your riding range.\n\nEnjoy precise and powerful braking with advanced hydraulic disc brakes. Designed for smooth, reliable stopping power, they provide control and safety in all conditions, ensuring confidence on every ride.\n\nEffortlessly tackle any terrain with the 7-speed Shimano gearing and vibrant LCD display for real-time speed, battery, and distance updates. The 48V model has a front fork with lockout for smoother rides, while the 52V model offers a front fork without lockout for added comfort on rough terrain.\n\nChoose between a single-crown front fork for a lighter ride (48V version) or a dual-crown fork for added stability and strength (52V version), ensuring optimal performance for any terrain.\n\nTackle any surface with 26\"x4\" fat tires, offering superior grip, stability, and comfort on all terrains—from sand to snow to rough trails.\n\nRide safely day or night with the Apex50's integrated lighting system, featuring a powerful front headlight, brake light, and turn signals for enhanced visibility and control on every ride.\n\nThe 48V Apex 50 features a single-shoulder suspension fork, dual motors with a peak power of 3000W, and an advanced AWD system that allows you to switch between rear-wheel drive, front-wheel drive, or dual-drive operation. Now capable of reaching a top speed of 35 MPH, it's designed for longer-range rides and urban commuting. Equipped with a compact headlight, the Apex 50 delivers smooth and efficient performance on well-paved roads and city streets.\n\nThe upgraded 52V Apex 50 now features a top speed of 35 MPH, dual-shoulder suspension fork, and dual motors with a 3000W peak power. Its versatile AWD mode allows for rear-wheel drive, front-wheel drive, or dual-drive operation. Equipped with a larger headlight, it's perfect for off-road trails, steep climbs, and challenging terrains.",
